	\L_02541:
	\L_0247d:
	ZH 1:
	'Huhu... A butterfly...'
	R
	'A butterfly...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...'
	R
	'A beautiful butterfly...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024b5:
	ZH 1:
	'It was Aristoles and Sheila.'
	R
	'Aristoles was walking with'
	R
	'Sheila as she wandered around,'
	R
	'like he was guarding her.'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_0247d:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey... Aristoles...'
	R
	'It’s pretty...'
	R
	'Huhu... Huhuhu...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah, Empress Sheila.'
	R
	'Running is dangerous.'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_02525:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles gently hugged Sheila'
	R
	'when she tried to run after'
	R
	'the butterfly.'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_0247d:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles... The butterfly’s'
	R
	'getting away...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Butterflies are beautiful'
	R
	'because they are free...'
	R
	'Let’s let it stay free...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_0247d:
	ZH 1:
	'Waaah... The butterfly...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Empress Sheila...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_02525:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles hugged Sheila.'
	\L_025a2:
	ZH 1:
	'She seemed under the affects'
	R
	'of the drug preventing her'
	R
	'from losing her mind.'
	\L_025a2:
	ZH 1:
	'When she was on the drug, she'
	R
	'behaved like a child. And like'
	R
	'a seductress, as well...'
	\L_025a2:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles gently cuddled the'
	R
	'innocent, pure child that'
	R
	'Sheila had become.'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Empress Sheila... No matter'
	R
	'what you become, I’ll always'
	R
	'protect you...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_02525:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles bent over to bury'
	R
	'his face in Sheila’s hair and'
	R
	'hugged her tighter.'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_0247d:
	ZH 1:
	'Ow... Aristoles... It hurts...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Uu... Uuu...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_02525:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance watched the couple hug'
