	'Sheila was soon brought in at'
	R
	'Rance’s order.'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024df:
	!VAR0516 : 18!
	\L_024d1:
	\L_0247d:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles...!'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Empress Sheila!!'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_02525:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles ran to Sheila and'
	R
	'knelt to her.'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_0247d:
	ZH 1:
	'Stop... Aristoles...'
	R
	'I’m not the Empress of Helman'
	R
	'or anything anymore..'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024ed:
	ZH 1:
	'No... I’ll forever be loyal to'
	R
	'you... So...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_0247d:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles...'
	\L_025a2:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m glad you’re alive...'
	\L_025a2:
	ZH 1:
	'Mother’s dead...'
	R
	'And Stessel’s gone...'
	R
	'I... I...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024ed:
	ZH 1:
	'You were lonely, weren’t'
	R
	'you...? You’ll be fine now...'
	R
	'I won’t leave you...'
	\L_025a2:
	ZH 1:
	'Even if my body were destroyed,'
	R
	'I would protect you with my'
	R
	'soul alone.'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_0247d:
	ZH 1:
	'Thanks...'
	R
	'Aristoles...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_02525:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles respectfully took'
	R
	'Sheila’s hand and gently'
	R
	'kissed the back of it.'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024df:
	\L_0254f:
	!VAR0516 : 1!
	\L_024d1:
	!VAR0516 : 5!
	\L_02541:
	\L_024ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Good for Sheila...'
	R
	'I wish you’d do stuff like'
	R
	'that to me...'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_0247d:
	ZH 1:
	'I’d rather die.'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024ed:
	ZH 1:
	'Booo!!'
	\L_025a2:
	\L_02595:
	\L_024b5:
	ZH 1:
	'Thus, Aristoles became Rance’s'
	R
	'subordinate.'
	\L_025a2:
